      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NO STOP SIGNS (4) finished in the minors last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 600m at The Meadows, taking a Special conditions H in an outstanding 34.37. Hard to top on the time from two back. ESPOIR (5) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Regal Jyle (34.18) in a Grade 4/5. Has the pace to be prominent. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Expected to feature again. TAW MAJOR (2) finished second (34.30) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 7th there. Has a strong record out of this box with five wins and four minor placings from nine starts. Can do much better this time. LUSH HOUR (7) is always hard to beat when she races here at this trip.",
